Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:16:05 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1416/1463] HERESY 1463: stems in eight (the voice in two, the
 winds apart), the stems by their proper titles in the tree and its downloads
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 15.10.2026: «В выхлопе стеммера предлагаю сразу вшить правильное именование... lead vocal, backing/choir vocals, winds». «Split: eight stems» after six (ep317, becruily's karaoke Mel-Roformer, BS-Roformer-SW, UVR's Wind_Inst: Lead Vocal, Backing Vocals, Drums, Bass, Guitar, Piano, Winds, Other and the Instrumental, about 10 minutes for 7 on a 3090), eight in the chain; the tree shows, compares and downloads a stem by its title where the lab gives one (Take - Lead Vocal.flac). Kitchen suite 823/0 (the six-stem check loosened to six after four).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
